flow/v2_pipeline/phase_02_01_mem_wrapper/codex_build.log:47392:    wire        at_cross_boundary = cur_at_high && !is_comp_hi && !cross_assemble;
flow/v2_pipeline/phase_02_01_mem_wrapper/codex_build.log:47394:    // upcoming_cross: sequential 16-bit at low half, FOLLOWED BY 32-bit at high half
