codex
The probe captured the bug clearly. At `pc=0x0e`, the first presented instruction is `8f930000` with `cross_assemble=0`, `at_cross_boundary=1`, and stale residue behavior; only after fallback does it become `00cf8f93`. The missing path is “consume a high-half 32-bit and simultaneously stage the next high-half 32-bit.”
