codex
The pipeline probe found a pre-existing decode omission: `idu` asserts `id_is_jalr=1` for `000f8067`, but `known_opcode` does not include `is_jalr`, so it marks a legal JALR illegal. This is why the seed now stops at commit 5 after the cross-boundary fix; I’m applying the one-token decode fix too so the seed can complete.
